<title>USA: Read-Rite files shelf for debt, equity.</title>
<headline>Read-Rite files shelf for debt, equity.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Read-Rite Corp on Friday filed with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission for a shelf offering of up to $350 million of senior or subordinated debt securities and common stock.</p>
<p>The Milpitas, Calif., supplier of magnetic recording heads for rigid disk drives said it would use proceeds from the sale for general corporate purposes, including capital expenditures, and for working capital.</p>
<p>The company did not name any underwriters for the sale.</p>
